      "principle": "Desertion for the purpose of seeking divorce under the Act means an intentional permanent abandonment of one spouse by the other without the other's consent and without reasonable cause.",
      "held": "The desertion for the purpose of seeking divorce under the Act means an intentional permanent forsaking and abandonment of one spouse by the other without the other's consent and without reasonable cause.",
