    {
      "principle": "Desertion is not a withdrawal from one place to another for a particular period, but involves both mental element and physical element.",
      "held": "Desertion is not the withdrawal from a place but from a state of things. Desertion, therefore, means withdrawing from the matrimonial obligations i.e., not permitting or allowing and facilitating the cohabitation between the parties.",
